    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "History Lane in Caledonia showcases an old schoolhouse, pioneer cabin, church, and town hall, offering a walk back in time.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitbluffcountry.com/minnesota/caledonia/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Houston County Historical Society Museum, located beside the fairgrounds, opens year‑round and displays the region’s rich heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitbluffcountry.com/minnesota/caledonia/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Caledonia’s Barn Quilt Driving Tour features about 59 painted barn quilts on historic barns, turning the countryside into an open‑air gallery.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.caledoniamnchamber.com/visit-our-town"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Beaver Creek, a crown jewel of Caledonia, has long been recognized as Houston County’s most important trout stream.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.caledoniamnchamber.com/visit-our-town"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Caledonia hosts Minnesota’s largest rural county fair, the 4‑H fair, featuring bandstand entertainment, farming exhibitions, and a midway.",
